  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Action to Strengthen Partnerships for Inclusion Resilience and Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth and women in Gourma-Rharous, Timbuktu and Ber Circles of Mali will be trained in sustainable and climate-smart rural livelihoods, improved seed production and will establish links with the various markets. The ASPIRE program will enhance food security through community and school gardens, promoting women&apos;s economic empowerment; integrate climate education and champion environmentally sustainable agriculture practices, including tree-planting initiatives, to strengthen community resilience.</narrative>
  </description>
